For the RecursionTracker class, here is the completed class definition:

```python
class RecursionTracker:
    def __init__(self):
        self._num_iterations = 0
        self.max_recursion_depth = 0

    @property
    def num_guesses(self):
        return self._num_iterations

    @num_guesses.setter
    def num_guesses(self, val):
        self._num_iterations = val
        self.on_recursion(val)

    def on_recursion(self, depth):
        if depth > self.max_recursion_depth:
            self.max_recursion_depth = depth

    def get_max_recursion_depth(self):
        return self.max_recursion_depth
```

